  "job_B16.9.4_20251003_114355": {
    "text": "Her is on \u00feis gewrite siu geswitelung \u00fe\u00e6re ger\u00e6dnisse \u00fee \u00feius geferr\u00e6den ger\u00e6d h\u00e6f\u00fe on \u00feegna gilde on\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc o\u00ferum a\u00fe on haligdome sealde so\u00fere heldr\u00e6denne for Gode & for worulde,\nGif hwilc gegilda for\u00fef\u00e6re, gebrynge hine eal gegildscipe \u00f0\u00e6r he to wilnie, & se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6rto ne cume\nAnd se gyldscipe hyrfe be healfre feorme \u00feone for\u00f0feredan.\nAnd \u00e6lc sceote twegen p\u00e6negas to \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6lmessan.\n& man \u00fe\u00e6rof gebrynge \u00fe\u00e6t gerise \u00e6t Sancte \u00c6\u00feeldry\u00fee.\nAnd gif \u00feonne hwylcum gyldan \u00feearf si his geferena fultumes, & hit gecyd wyr\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s gildan nihstan\nGif se hlaford hit forgymeleasie gylde an pund, butun he on hlafordes neode beo, o\u00fe\u00fee legerb\u00e6re.\nAnd gyf hwa gyldan ofstlea, ne si nan o\u00feer butun eahta pund to bote.\nGif se stlaga \u00feonne \u00fea bote oferhogie, wrece eal gildscipe \u00feone gildan & ealle beran.\nGif hit \u00feonne an do, beran ealle gelice.\nAnd gif \u00e6nig gilda hwilcne man ofstlea, & he neadwraca si, & his bismer bete.\nAnd se ofstlagana twelfhende sy fylste \u00e6lc gegylda healf mearc to fylste.\nGyf se ofstlagena ceorl si twegen oran, gif he Wylisc si, anne oran.\nGif se gilda \u00feonne hw\u00e6ne mid dysie & myd dole stlea, bere sylf \u00fe\u00e6t he worhte.\nAnd gif gegilda his gegildan \u00feurh his agen dysi ofstlea, bere sylf wi\u00fe magas \u00fe\u00e6t he br\u00e6c, & his gegilde\nAnd gif gegilda myd \u00fe\u00e6m ete o\u00f0\u00f0e drince \u00fee his gegildan stlog, butun hit beforan cyninge, o\u00f0\u00f0e\nGif hwilc gegilda o\u00feerne misgrete, gylde anne syster huniges.\nAnd gif hwa o\u00feerne misgrete, gylde anne syster huniges butun he hine mid his twam gesetlun geladie.\nGif cniht w\u00e6pn brede, gilde se hlaford an pund, & h\u00e6bbe se hlaford \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge.\nAnd him eal gildscipe gefylste \u00fe\u00e6t he his feoh of h\u00e6bbe.\nAnd gif cniht o\u00feerne gewundie, wrece hit hlaford, & eal gyldscipe on, & sece \u00fe\u00e6t he sece, \u00fe\u00e6t he feorh\nAnd gif cniht binnan stig sitte, gylde anne syster huniges.\nAnd gif hwa fotsetlan h\u00e6bbe do \u00fe\u00e6t ylce.\nAnd gif hwilc gegilda ut of lande for\u00f0fere, o\u00f0\u00f0e beo gesycled, gefeccan hine his gegildan.\nAnd hine gebringan deadne o\u00f0\u00f0e cucene \u00fe\u00e6r he to wilnie.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6m ylcan wyte \u00fee hit gecweden is.\nGif he \u00e6t ham for\u00f0fer\u00f0 & gegilda \u00fe\u00e6t lic ne gesec\u00f0.\n& se gegilda \u00fee ne gesece his.",
